(Ord. No. 051611a, § 1(1), 2-15-2021)

135:
The planning commission shall have the power to:
(1) Advise the council of the city on applications for amendments and variances and conditional use permits authorized pursuant to the city's zoning ordinance;
(2) Conduct public hearings related to the administration of the city's zoning ordinance;
(3) Dispense general information to the public about the zoning ordinance upon request;
